    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/6d5fccd8066df6b9db1d1f8b5bd0c2eb.avif?t=1739159533\" width=600 height=64 /></span>Super Polished is a Top-down cleaning roguelite where you clean up while the mess is still being made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/55c93d44bb20adaecf0ddb76bd83ef22.avif?t=1739159533\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the contaminators with your weapons and clean up the messes they leave behind with your cleaning equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/f871ed9c0650ee33a7c9f9cfce8ea7e6.poster.avif?t=1739159533\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/f871ed9c0650ee33a7c9f9cfce8ea7e6.webm?t=1739159533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/f871ed9c0650ee33a7c9f9cfce8ea7e6.mp4?t=1739159533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/57d33c0a9b470ba3dcd0b060221f0512.avif?t=1739159533\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money destroying contaminators, cleaning up their messes, and getting a large cleanup bonus if you clean everything before shift end. Use this money to buy new equipment that will help you face the challenges of later levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/b09430eba326bad6766fda76591d8893.poster.avif?t=1739159533\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/b09430eba326bad6766fda76591d8893.webm?t=1739159533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/b09430eba326bad6766fda76591d8893.mp4?t=1739159533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/2cba957a22193d8d653f55d2914d61b4.avif?t=1739159533\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a KPI to meet, if your balance isn\u2019t high enough for each performance review your contract will be terminated. So, consider not spending your money as fast as you can make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/fb7e6667d63c174712b7ca01b57f3a3e.poster.avif?t=1739159533\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/fb7e6667d63c174712b7ca01b57f3a3e.webm?t=1739159533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/fb7e6667d63c174712b7ca01b57f3a3e.mp4?t=1739159533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/6d5fccd8066df6b9db1d1f8b5bd0c2eb.avif?t=1739159533\" width=600 height=64 /></span>Super Polished is a Top-down cleaning roguelite where you clean up while the mess is still being made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/55c93d44bb20adaecf0ddb76bd83ef22.avif?t=1739159533\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the contaminators with your weapons and clean up the messes they leave behind with your cleaning equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/f871ed9c0650ee33a7c9f9cfce8ea7e6.poster.avif?t=1739159533\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/f871ed9c0650ee33a7c9f9cfce8ea7e6.webm?t=1739159533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/f871ed9c0650ee33a7c9f9cfce8ea7e6.mp4?t=1739159533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/57d33c0a9b470ba3dcd0b060221f0512.avif?t=1739159533\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money destroying contaminators, cleaning up their messes, and getting a large cleanup bonus if you clean everything before shift end. Use this money to buy new equipment that will help you face the challenges of later levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/b09430eba326bad6766fda76591d8893.poster.avif?t=1739159533\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/b09430eba326bad6766fda76591d8893.webm?t=1739159533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/b09430eba326bad6766fda76591d8893.mp4?t=1739159533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/2cba957a22193d8d653f55d2914d61b4.avif?t=1739159533\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have a KPI to meet, if your balance isn\u2019t high enough for each performance review your contract will be terminated. So, consider not spending your money as fast as you can make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/fb7e6667d63c174712b7ca01b57f3a3e.poster.avif?t=1739159533\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/fb7e6667d63c174712b7ca01b57f3a3e.webm?t=1739159533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894600/extras/fb7e6667d63c174712b7ca01b57f3a3e.mp4?t=1739159533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
